 6\n\nThe Alameda County Fire Department hosts an open house at Station 17
  for those interested in a career as a Firefighter Recruit\, EMT\, or Par
 amedic. Attendees can meet department personnel\, ask questions\, learn a
 bout the hiring process\, and gain insights into the academy\, training\,
  and skills needed to succeed. Applications are currently being accepted\
 ; the portal closes November 13 at 5 PM.
